   "titulo": "Two prepositions cases",
   "texto": [
    "**Na** with a fixed location usually goes with location: **na biurku**, «on the desktop». **Pod** and **nad** usually go with instruments: **pod stołem** («under the table»), **nad stołem** («on the table»)."
   ]
